## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate scholarly expertise in biblical and systematic theology.
- Conduct advanced biblical and theological research.
- Critically evaluate historical and contemporary theological perspectives.
- Examine Pentecostal–Charismatic theology and pneumatology.
- Develop original scholarly contributions to theological studies.
- Demonstrate advanced theological writing and academic competence.
- Contribute to Christian theological education and scholarship.
